  ],
  "duration_s": 386.170998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道中国的省名都是怎么来的吗？我猜十个人里八个会说是按山川河流取的，说什么山东就是山的东边，河南就是河的南边，听着确实有道理，但我今天把话撂这儿。中国的省名远没有你想的那么简单，每一个名字背后都藏着一套古人精心设计的地理密码。真正排在榜首的那个省名两个字里，装着一个民族的精神故乡。听完你绝对忘不了，今天咱们就来扒一扒那些古人取名最有讲究的省份。老规矩，开讲之前，劳烦您顺手扣个一点颗红心，让我看看都是谁在听第十名。福建福建的取名方式用的是拼字法福，取自福州建取自建州，就是今天的建瓯。唐朝的时候设了福建精略，使管辖福州和建州一带。从此福建这个名字就定了下来。可符和建这两个字，选的也有深意，福州的福就是福气的福。传说五代时期，闵王王审之把福州治理的风调雨顺、百姓安居福州因此得名。有福之州。建州的建是建造的建，建州是闽北的门户，从中原进入福建的第一战，是建功立业的起点。福气加上建功福建这个名字，听着就让人心里舒坦，而且您发现没有？中国三十四个省级行政区里，名字里带福字的就只有福建一个。古人把福字用在省名里，可见对这块地方寄予了多大的期望。一个福字带福气，一个建字有根基，两个字拼在一起，就是福建有福气有根基的地方。第九名，云南很多人都好奇，有云南为什么没有云？北？答案特别简单，因为云南的云不是天上的，云是云岭的云云岭，是横断山脉的一段。从西藏东部一直延伸到云南西北部。答，拔四五千米，常年云雾缭绕，云岭的南边就是云南。所以云南的意思是，云岭之南跟天上的白云没关系。汉武帝的时候派人出使西南，走到云岭，南边发现了一大片土地，就叫它云南。从那以后，这个名字用了两千多年没换过，可为什么没有云北？因为云岭的北边是四川和西藏，人家早就有自己的名字了，不需要再叫云北。古人取名讲究以山为界，山南叫一个名山，北叫另一个名各管各的地盘。一座山岭把南北分开，南边的就叫云南，名字简单可道理深。第八名。浙江浙江这个名字来自一条江，这条江就是钱塘江，古时候叫浙江。浙字本身就带着讲究，它的意思是曲折，专指江水盘回曲折的样子。您想想钱塘江到了下游弯弯绕绕拐了多少道弯，这这个字把江水的形态直接写进了名字里，可您知道吗？浙江的简称浙其实跟名字是同一个字，这在省份里不多见。浙江阴江得名，以曲折为名，一个省的名字，把一条大江最先民的特征永远刻了下来。第七名、江苏、江苏是江宁和苏州各取一个字合起来的。江宁就是南京，苏州就是姑苏，一个江一个书。江是长江，大气磅礴，苏轼苏醒复苏，万物复苏的苏江是刚苏，是柔江势壮阔，苏轼温柔合在一起，刚柔并济，可您知道吗？江苏这个名字是清朝才定下来的。明朝的时候，江苏和安徽还是一家叫难直隶。清朝康熙年间，江南省一分为二，去江宁府和苏州府的首次才有了江苏。您看一个苏字，还带着复苏的好兆头。第六名。四川四川这个名字听起来简单，可它的来历比很多人想的都复杂。有人说是因为境内有四条、大河、岷江、沱江、嘉陵江、乌江。也有人说，是因为北宋时期设了益州、子州、利州、夔州四路，合称川峡四路，简称四川。不管是哪条河还是哪四路，一个川字，把四川盆地万里顺水，汇聚千山环抱的地形全写进去了。四川简称蜀，蜀是古蜀国的蜀，是蚕丛。榆公的蜀是三星堆，金沙的蜀，一个川，一个蜀，一个讲地形，一个讲历史，两个名字，把四川的魂全抓住了。从第十到第六，福建是福州加建州，云南是云岭之南，浙江一因钱塘江得名，江苏是江宁加苏州、四川因四条大船得名。可这五个还不是最有讲究的。接下来第五道第一，一个比一个震撼，有一个省两个字里藏着一个黎明，还有一个省两个字里装着一位圣人，最后那个两个字里装着一个民族的精神故乡。他是哪个下级马上更新，您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00001",
      "start_ms": 170,
      "end_ms": 3450,
      "text": "你知道中国的省名都是怎么来的吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4350,
      "end_ms": 8470,
      "text": "我猜十个人里八个会说是按山川河流取的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00003",
      "start_ms": 8930,
      "end_ms": 11050,
      "text": "说什么山东就是山的东边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00004",
      "start_ms": 11510,
      "end_ms": 13390,
      "text": "河南就是河的南边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00005",
      "start_ms": 13930,
      "end_ms": 15290,
      "text": "听着确实有道理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00006",
      "start_ms": 16070,
      "end_ms": 17830,
      "text": "但我今天把话撂这儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00007",
      "start_ms": 18450,
      "end_ms": 21710,
      "text": "中国的省名远没有你想的那么简单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00008",
      "start_ms": 22270,
      "end_ms": 26910,
      "text": "每一个名字背后都藏着一套古人精心设计的地理密码。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00009",
      "start_ms": 27450,
      "end_ms": 31260,
      "text": "真正排在榜首的那个省名两个字里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00010",
      "start_ms": 31280,
      "end_ms": 33520,
      "text": "装着一个民族的精神故乡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00011",
      "start_ms": 33940,
      "end_ms": 35380,
      "text": "听完你绝对忘不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00012",
      "start_ms": 35440,
      "end_ms": 39200,
      "text": "今天咱们就来扒一扒那些古人取名最有讲究的省份。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00013",
      "start_ms": 40040,
      "end_ms": 40700,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00014",
      "start_ms": 41000,
      "end_ms": 41960,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00015",
      "start_ms": 42120,
      "end_ms": 45240,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手扣个一点颗红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00016",
      "start_ms": 45580,
      "end_ms": 48660,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00017",
      "start_ms": 49640,
      "end_ms": 56100,
      "text": "福建福建的取名方式用的是拼字法福，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00018",
      "start_ms": 56140,
      "end_ms": 59140,
      "text": "取自福州建取自建州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00019",
      "start_ms": 60360,
      "end_ms": 61875,
      "text": "就是今天的建瓯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00020",
      "start_ms": 62870,
      "end_ms": 65370,
      "text": "唐朝的时候设了福建精略，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00021",
      "start_ms": 65370,
      "end_ms": 68715,
      "text": "使管辖福州和建州一带。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00022",
      "start_ms": 69500,
      "end_ms": 72725,
      "text": "从此福建这个名字就定了下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00023",
      "start_ms": 73250,
      "end_ms": 74510,
      "text": "可符和建这两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00024",
      "start_ms": 74510,
      "end_ms": 75710,
      "text": "选的也有深意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00025",
      "start_ms": 75950,
      "end_ms": 78455,
      "text": "福州的福就是福气的福。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00026",
      "start_ms": 79000,
      "end_ms": 80300,
      "text": "传说五代时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00027",
      "start_ms": 80380,
      "end_ms": 87660,
      "text": "闵王王审之把福州治理的风调雨顺、百姓安居福州因此得名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00028",
      "start_ms": 87680,
      "end_ms": 88625,
      "text": "有福之州。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00029",
      "start_ms": 89190,
      "end_ms": 91235,
      "text": "建州的建是建造的建，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00030",
      "start_ms": 91760,
      "end_ms": 94265,
      "text": "建州是闽北的门户，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00031",
      "start_ms": 95090,
      "end_ms": 97405,
      "text": "从中原进入福建的第一战，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00032",
      "start_ms": 97970,
      "end_ms": 99865,
      "text": "是建功立业的起点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00033",
      "start_ms": 100830,
      "end_ms": 104105,
      "text": "福气加上建功福建这个名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00034",
      "start_ms": 104420,
      "end_ms": 106135,
      "text": "听着就让人心里舒坦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00035",
      "start_ms": 106630,
      "end_ms": 107825,
      "text": "而且您发现没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00036",
      "start_ms": 108150,
      "end_ms": 110385,
      "text": "中国三十四个省级行政区里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00037",
      "start_ms": 110710,
      "end_ms": 113745,
      "text": "名字里带福字的就只有福建一个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00038",
      "start_ms": 114810,
      "end_ms": 117230,
      "text": "古人把福字用在省名里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00039",
      "start_ms": 117230,
      "end_ms": 119675,
      "text": "可见对这块地方寄予了多大的期望。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00040",
      "start_ms": 120150,
      "end_ms": 121550,
      "text": "一个福字带福气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00041",
      "start_ms": 121770,
      "end_ms": 123230,
      "text": "一个建字有根基，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00042",
      "start_ms": 123530,
      "end_ms": 124850,
      "text": "两个字拼在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00043",
      "start_ms": 124850,
      "end_ms": 127770,
      "text": "就是福建有福气有根基的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00044",
      "start_ms": 128170,
      "end_ms": 128850,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00045",
      "start_ms": 129230,
      "end_ms": 132030,
      "text": "云南很多人都好奇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00046",
      "start_ms": 132350,
      "end_ms": 133950,
      "text": "有云南为什么没有云？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00047",
      "start_ms": 133950,
      "end_ms": 134190,
      "text": "北？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00048",
      "start_ms": 134630,
      "end_ms": 135790,
      "text": "答案特别简单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00049",
      "start_ms": 135970,
      "end_ms": 138370,
      "text": "因为云南的云不是天上的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00050",
      "start_ms": 138370,
      "end_ms": 141250,
      "text": "云是云岭的云云岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00051",
      "start_ms": 141250,
      "end_ms": 143210,
      "text": "是横断山脉的一段。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00052",
      "start_ms": 143650,
      "end_ms": 147890,
      "text": "从西藏东部一直延伸到云南西北部。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00053",
      "start_ms": 148250,
      "end_ms": 148490,
      "text": "答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00054",
      "start_ms": 148610,
      "end_ms": 149775,
      "text": "拔四五千米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00055",
      "start_ms": 150200,
      "end_ms": 151920,
      "text": "常年云雾缭绕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00056",
      "start_ms": 152240,
      "end_ms": 154200,
      "text": "云岭的南边就是云南。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00057",
      "start_ms": 154220,
      "end_ms": 155420,
      "text": "所以云南的意思是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00058",
      "start_ms": 155420,
      "end_ms": 158920,
      "text": "云岭之南跟天上的白云没关系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00059",
      "start_ms": 159360,
      "end_ms": 161500,
      "text": "汉武帝的时候派人出使西南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00060",
      "start_ms": 161860,
      "end_ms": 162660,
      "text": "走到云岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00061",
      "start_ms": 162660,
      "end_ms": 164680,
      "text": "南边发现了一大片土地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00062",
      "start_ms": 164860,
      "end_ms": 165740,
      "text": "就叫它云南。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00063",
      "start_ms": 166240,
      "end_ms": 166880,
      "text": "从那以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00064",
      "start_ms": 166880,
      "end_ms": 168980,
      "text": "这个名字用了两千多年没换过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00065",
      "start_ms": 169820,
      "end_ms": 171140,
      "text": "可为什么没有云北？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00066",
      "start_ms": 171800,
      "end_ms": 174420,
      "text": "因为云岭的北边是四川和西藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00067",
      "start_ms": 175080,
      "end_ms": 177000,
      "text": "人家早就有自己的名字了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00068",
      "start_ms": 177340,
      "end_ms": 178800,
      "text": "不需要再叫云北。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00069",
      "start_ms": 179320,
      "end_ms": 181930,
      "text": "古人取名讲究以山为界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00070",
      "start_ms": 182470,
      "end_ms": 184350,
      "text": "山南叫一个名山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00071",
      "start_ms": 184450,
      "end_ms": 186910,
      "text": "北叫另一个名各管各的地盘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00072",
      "start_ms": 187050,
      "end_ms": 189230,
      "text": "一座山岭把南北分开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00073",
      "start_ms": 189630,
      "end_ms": 191510,
      "text": "南边的就叫云南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00074",
      "start_ms": 191950,
      "end_ms": 193950,
      "text": "名字简单可道理深。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00075",
      "start_ms": 194830,
      "end_ms": 195510,
      "text": "第八名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00076",
      "start_ms": 196030,
      "end_ms": 200370,
      "text": "浙江浙江这个名字来自一条江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00077",
      "start_ms": 201310,
      "end_ms": 203430,
      "text": "这条江就是钱塘江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00078",
      "start_ms": 203910,
      "end_ms": 205330,
      "text": "古时候叫浙江。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00079",
      "start_ms": 206110,
      "end_ms": 207970,
      "text": "浙字本身就带着讲究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00080",
      "start_ms": 208190,
      "end_ms": 209410,
      "text": "它的意思是曲折，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00081",
      "start_ms": 210280,
      "end_ms": 212980,
      "text": "专指江水盘回曲折的样子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00082",
      "start_ms": 213780,
      "end_ms": 219440,
      "text": "您想想钱塘江到了下游弯弯绕绕拐了多少道弯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00083",
      "start_ms": 219680,
      "end_ms": 224120,
      "text": "这这个字把江水的形态直接写进了名字里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00084",
      "start_ms": 224500,
      "end_ms": 225360,
      "text": "可您知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00085",
      "start_ms": 225520,
      "end_ms": 229560,
      "text": "浙江的简称浙其实跟名字是同一个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00086",
      "start_ms": 230360,
      "end_ms": 231940,
      "text": "这在省份里不多见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00087",
      "start_ms": 232720,
      "end_ms": 234760,
      "text": "浙江阴江得名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00088",
      "start_ms": 235040,
      "end_ms": 236440,
      "text": "以曲折为名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00089",
      "start_ms": 237160,
      "end_ms": 238360,
      "text": "一个省的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00090",
      "start_ms": 238540,
      "end_ms": 242055,
      "text": "把一条大江最先民的特征永远刻了下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00091",
      "start_ms": 242600,
      "end_ms": 248435,
      "text": "第七名、江苏、江苏是江宁和苏州各取一个字合起来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00092",
      "start_ms": 248950,
      "end_ms": 250030,
      "text": "江宁就是南京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00093",
      "start_ms": 250310,
      "end_ms": 251395,
      "text": "苏州就是姑苏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00094",
      "start_ms": 252030,
      "end_ms": 253515,
      "text": "一个江一个书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00095",
      "start_ms": 254100,
      "end_ms": 255015,
      "text": "江是长江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00096",
      "start_ms": 255400,
      "end_ms": 256280,
      "text": "大气磅礴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00097",
      "start_ms": 256760,
      "end_ms": 258575,
      "text": "苏轼苏醒复苏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00098",
      "start_ms": 259040,
      "end_ms": 262330,
      "text": "万物复苏的苏江是刚苏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00099",
      "start_ms": 262370,
      "end_ms": 264665,
      "text": "是柔江势壮阔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00100",
      "start_ms": 265080,
      "end_ms": 267045,
      "text": "苏轼温柔合在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00101",
      "start_ms": 267740,
      "end_ms": 268755,
      "text": "刚柔并济，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00102",
      "start_ms": 269140,
      "end_ms": 270025,
      "text": "可您知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00103",
      "start_ms": 270320,
      "end_ms": 273445,
      "text": "江苏这个名字是清朝才定下来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00104",
      "start_ms": 274300,
      "end_ms": 275260,
      "text": "明朝的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00105",
      "start_ms": 275360,
      "end_ms": 279025,
      "text": "江苏和安徽还是一家叫难直隶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00106",
      "start_ms": 279870,
      "end_ms": 281365,
      "text": "清朝康熙年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00107",
      "start_ms": 281830,
      "end_ms": 283205,
      "text": "江南省一分为二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00108",
      "start_ms": 283530,
      "end_ms": 286865,
      "text": "去江宁府和苏州府的首次才有了江苏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00109",
      "start_ms": 287520,
      "end_ms": 288980,
      "text": "您看一个苏字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00110",
      "start_ms": 289080,
      "end_ms": 290855,
      "text": "还带着复苏的好兆头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00111",
      "start_ms": 291090,
      "end_ms": 291685,
      "text": "第六名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00112",
      "start_ms": 292050,
      "end_ms": 295530,
      "text": "四川四川这个名字听起来简单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00113",
      "start_ms": 295770,
      "end_ms": 297930,
      "text": "可它的来历比很多人想的都复杂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00114",
      "start_ms": 298690,
      "end_ms": 304450,
      "text": "有人说是因为境内有四条、大河、岷江、沱江、嘉陵江、乌江。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00115",
      "start_ms": 304990,
      "end_ms": 305770,
      "text": "也有人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00116",
      "start_ms": 306050,
      "end_ms": 311570,
      "text": "是因为北宋时期设了益州、子州、利州、夔州四路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00117",
      "start_ms": 311770,
      "end_ms": 313370,
      "text": "合称川峡四路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00118",
      "start_ms": 313550,
      "end_ms": 314610,
      "text": "简称四川。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00119",
      "start_ms": 315470,
      "end_ms": 318390,
      "text": "不管是哪条河还是哪四路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00120",
      "start_ms": 318630,
      "end_ms": 319590,
      "text": "一个川字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00121",
      "start_ms": 319990,
      "end_ms": 322340,
      "text": "把四川盆地万里顺水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00122",
      "start_ms": 322440,
      "end_ms": 326260,
      "text": "汇聚千山环抱的地形全写进去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00123",
      "start_ms": 326700,
      "end_ms": 327960,
      "text": "四川简称蜀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00124",
      "start_ms": 328760,
      "end_ms": 330380,
      "text": "蜀是古蜀国的蜀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00125",
      "start_ms": 331020,
      "end_ms": 331820,
      "text": "是蚕丛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00126",
      "start_ms": 332240,
      "end_ms": 334760,
      "text": "榆公的蜀是三星堆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00127",
      "start_ms": 335340,
      "end_ms": 336380,
      "text": "金沙的蜀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00128",
      "start_ms": 336980,
      "end_ms": 337580,
      "text": "一个川，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00129",
      "start_ms": 338059,
      "end_ms": 338600,
      "text": "一个蜀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00130",
      "start_ms": 339060,
      "end_ms": 340200,
      "text": "一个讲地形，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00131",
      "start_ms": 340580,
      "end_ms": 341580,
      "text": "一个讲历史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00132",
      "start_ms": 342000,
      "end_ms": 342780,
      "text": "两个名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00133",
      "start_ms": 342860,
      "end_ms": 344860,
      "text": "把四川的魂全抓住了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00134",
      "start_ms": 345020,
      "end_ms": 346480,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00135",
      "start_ms": 346820,
      "end_ms": 348880,
      "text": "福建是福州加建州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00136",
      "start_ms": 349260,
      "end_ms": 350920,
      "text": "云南是云岭之南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00137",
      "start_ms": 351300,
      "end_ms": 353205,
      "text": "浙江一因钱塘江得名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00138",
      "start_ms": 353720,
      "end_ms": 357955,
      "text": "江苏是江宁加苏州、四川因四条大船得名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00139",
      "start_ms": 358510,
      "end_ms": 361695,
      "text": "可这五个还不是最有讲究的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00140",
      "start_ms": 362620,
      "end_ms": 364505,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00141",
      "start_ms": 365120,
      "end_ms": 366425,
      "text": "一个比一个震撼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00142",
      "start_ms": 367340,
      "end_ms": 370895,
      "text": "有一个省两个字里藏着一个黎明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00143",
      "start_ms": 371470,
      "end_ms": 374795,
      "text": "还有一个省两个字里装着一位圣人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00144",
      "start_ms": 375420,
      "end_ms": 379615,
      "text": "最后那个两个字里装着一个民族的精神故乡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00145",
      "start_ms": 379880,
      "end_ms": 382210,
      "text": "他是哪个下级马上更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_acdf28603fafbffb_s00146",
      "start_ms": 382370,
      "end_ms": 386045,
      "text": "您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
